-- title:
--   Satz 1 (Hauptsatz): a point on all extreme supports of a non-degenerate $S$ is representable by $S$
-- statement:
--   Let $S \subseteq \mathbb{R}^n$ be a finite non-degenerate point system (no nonzero $\alpha$ has $(\alpha s) = 0$ for all $s \in S$). Suppose $x \in \mathbb{R}^n$ satisfies every extreme support inequality of $S$: $(\alpha x) \ge 0$ for every extreme support $\alpha$ of $S$. Then $x$ is a nonnegative linear combination of the points of $S$:
--   $$x = \lambda a + \mu b + \cdots, \qquad \lambda \ge 0,\ \mu \ge 0,\ \dots \qquad (a, b, \dots \in S).$$
--
--   This is the finite-basis (Minkowski–Weyl) theorem for cones in Weyl's form: the convex pyramid cut out by the finitely many extreme supports is exactly the cone generated by $S$. If $S$ has no extreme support at all, the conclusion is that every point of $\mathbb{R}^n$ is representable.
--
--   (Weyl: "Gegeben ein endliches nicht-ausgeartetes Punktsystem S. Ein Punkt x, für welchen alle extremen Stützungsgleichungen zu S erfüllt sind, läßt sich linear-positiv aus den Punkten a, b, ⋯ des Systems S kombinieren.")
--
--   **Formalization Note** "Alle extremen Stützungsgleichungen erfüllt" is read as: all extreme support *inequalities* hold, as the paper's use of the result shows. "Linear-positiv" means nonnegative coefficients.
-- source:
--   Weyl, Elementare Theorie der konvexen Polyeder, Comment. Math. Helv. (1935), p. 291, Satz 1

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_WeylPolyhedra_Shared_Representable
import Definitions.Def_WeylPolyhedra_Shared_NonDegenerate
import Definitions.Def_WeylPolyhedra_Shared_IsExtremeSupport

namespace WeylPolyhedra.Polyhedron

/-- Weyl (1935), §1, p. 291, Satz 1 (Hauptsatz): let `S` be a finite non-degenerate point
system in `ℝⁿ`. Every point `x` satisfying all extreme support inequalities of `S`
(`α ⬝ᵥ x ≥ 0` for every extreme support `α` of `S`) is a nonnegative linear combination of the
points of `S`. -/
theorem hauptsatz {n : ℕ} (S : Finset (Fin n → ℝ)) (hS : Shared.NonDegenerate S) (x : Fin n → ℝ)
    (hx : ∀ α : Fin n → ℝ, Shared.IsExtremeSupport S α → 0 ≤ α ⬝ᵥ x) :
    Shared.Representable S x := by sorry

end WeylPolyhedra.Polyhedron
